 it up to several wires but before they  can come up with anything conclusive the  lion cub wakes up this shocks match as  the sedative was supposed to work for a  further two hours at the same same time  he gets a call from the zoo worker from  before informing him that all the lions  in the zoo have started roaring  aggressively when Mitch adds everything  up he concludes that somehow the Lions  have started to communicate long  distance using unusual hyper gamma  frequencies  how did he figure that out in Botswana  Jack's mom Elizabeth examines all the  dead tourists and figures out that they  have all been finished off in a  different fashion compared to what lions  normally do usually lines go for The  Knack and inflict a quick death but in  this instance the victims have severed  carotid arteries implying that they have  died in agonizingly slow death Elizabeth  immediately summons her son and tells  him that the animals have started to  change something which his father Robert  had predicted long ago it turns out that  Robert was an avid animal researcher and  in particular he focused on their  behavior he knew that the animals would  soon turn sadly none of his colleagues  or family members believed him and  instead just called him names Elizabeth  then tells Jackson to visit Japan and  retrieve his father's research materials  as that's where he spent his final years  though she hated him before she believes  that Robert's theory is coming true and  they need to know about it and control  it before it causes more destruction  Jackson immediately agrees to go and  banged up Abraham also joins him  following this we are taken to Paris  where the French tourists from earlier  Chloe is shown she turns out to be an  intelligence Analyst at dgse which is  the equivalent of the British MI6 or the  American CIA after work as Chloe gets  ready to depart she is approached by a  sketchy guy in a suit named Gaspard  Alves he appears to know everything  about her including how she survived a  lion attack in Botswana he explains  about how animals around the world have  become violent and erratic to prove his  assumptions at first he takes her to a  morgue where the dog attack victims have  been brought realizing that they don't  have much time left and because of  Chloe's vast skill set he wants her to  Aid him in his investigation meanwhile  Jackson and Abraham reach Tokyo and meet  Monaco the second wife of Robert Jackson  informs her that they are here to  retrieve the research materials from his  father but menaka replies that she  doesn't have them she reveals that  everything is kept safe on a secluded  Island near Fukushima nuclear Center  wasting no time the group leaves for  Fukushima on a private plane minako  hands the boys a geiger counter a device  to measure radiation saying the place is  still not safe to visit just then the  plane is attacked by a swarm of bats  Jackson is shocked to see bats flying at  such a high altitude not to mention in  the daytime unfortunately the plane  loses control and crashes into the sea  killing Monaco and the pilot Jackson and  Abraham are devastated by the incident  but nonetheless they decide to explore  the island before help arrives after  some hours of walking they finally come  across Robert's Research Place strangely  they also find some horses that have  their eyes gouged out later after  entering the main research house Abraham  discovers the horse's eyes kept inside a  glass jar they then play some of the  research videos where Robert mentions  that the horses have become aggressive  he even talks about their defiant pupils  with this Abraham and Jackson conclude  that Robert blinded the horses when they  became aggressive on the other hand the  sketchy suit guy from earlier Gaspard  approaches Mitch and requests that they  work together to find out about the  changing animal behavior Mitch agrees  straight away but on one condition Jaime  will also join them in the next scene  Gaspard and his team arrive at Shima  Island and rescue Abraham and Jackson  They then reach a building in Tokyo  where Mitch and Jamie have already  arrived following this Gaspard  introduces the four to Mr Delavan the  head of the secret animal behavior  investigation Delavan shows them some  clips from around the world where  different animals are attacking and  killing humans he then asserts that the  animal pandemic has begun and they need  to act fast before it can cause more  damage at last he summons the leader of  the team who is none other than Chloe we  are then taken to Mississippi where a  prisoner Evan Lee Hartley is about to be  executed for killing a number of hunters  around the area but strangely before the  procedure can take place a pack of  aggressive wolves enter the prison and  kill everyone on site except for Evan  for some reason they appear to be  submissive to him the following day  Chloe suggests that the entire group  remain classified and to travel to  Mississippi to gather information about  the wolf attack when they arrive she  assigns Abraham and Mitch to catch a  wolf for research purposes and asks the  others to accompany her to the prison  the group is skeptical about her  decisions but nonetheless they agree at  the prison Chloe meets Deputy Kraft and  agent Ben from the FBI while Chloe and  craft are conversing Jackson takes a  closer look at the CCTV footage of the  attack and sees that the death row  prisoner Evan Lee was mysteriously  controlling a wolf having been out there  warging following this the group walks  out of the prison with Jackson stating  that the Wolves need an alpha leader to  control them he then assumes that the  alpha leader is Evan Lee later at night  Jaime researches Heavenly and finds that  he had no criminal background until 2008  when he stabbed a group of hunters to  death for no conclusive reason the next  day Abraham and Mitch go to a nearby  Forest while Chloe Jackson and Jaime are  at the prison area looking around the  Wolves Footprints and their tracks  Jackson discovers that the Wolves  entered the prison by digging holes  underneath the metal fence and also  helped Evan Lee escape on the other hand  as Mitch and Abraham are wandering  through the forest Heavenly and his pack  of wolves surround them but fortunately  before he can do something bad Evan  hears a wolf howling and runs towards it  leaving mentioned Abraham on harmed  meanwhile Jaime interviews an  acquaintance of Evan Lee and learns that  he has always had a Bible on him which  supposedly has some writings on it so  Jaime returns to the prison with a fake  Alias and goes straight to Evan's former  cell after searching for a bit she  eventually finds the Bible and takes it  with her on the other hand Jackson and  Chloe also Unite with Mitch and Abraham  together they decide to leave with an  injured wolf that was recently shot by  the hunters the scene then shifts to the  hotel room where the group is trying to  treat the injured wolf and find out the  reason for its aggressive behavior after  some research Mitch states that the wolf  is infected with a harmful bacteria  which he believes is responsible for  their change in Behavior he then  prepares a chemical solution and  proceeds to test it with the wolf's  blood if the mixture starts reacting and  showing bubbles this will prove his  theory that the bacteria is the culprit  lo and behold the blood reacts so  violently that it causes the experiment  vessel to explode later agent Ben from  the FBI visits their room and informs  Chloe that the deputy is on his way to  interrogate her team but before he can  arrive the group packs their belongings  and leaves in the last scene a group  meets Jaime at the parking lot where she  hands over the Bible she found earlier  Jaime also says that Evan Lee has  underlined all the animal references in  it just then Chloe pulls out a photo of  Evan Lee with another person from the  Bible Jackson i